---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import {copy} from '../../data'; const c=copy.en;
---
<BaseLayout title="About me" description={c.aboutText} lang="en" alternate="/about/">
<section class="container section prose"><p class="eyebrow">{c.role}</p><h1>{c.aboutTitle}</h1><p>{c.aboutText}</p><h2>{c.stackTitle}</h2><p>PHP · Symfony · Laravel · 1C-Bitrix D7/ORM · JavaScript · Vue 3 · PostgreSQL · MySQL · Redis · Docker · REST API · Kafka · Logstash · OpenSearch</p><p>Also: TypeScript, Inertia, testing, CI/CD, and AI-assisted development with Codex.</p><h2>Additional Education</h2><p><strong><a href="https://21-school.ru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">School 21 by Sber</a> — graduate</strong></p><p>School 21 is Sber’s education initiative in digital technology. Its practice-oriented format centers on project tasks and independent work. Through its peer-to-peer approach, participants exchange knowledge, review one another’s solutions, and give feedback; team projects complement individual problem-solving.</p><p>I see this education as a complement to my commercial experience and engineering projects.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.section{padding-block:88px}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.08em}h1{font-size:clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4.25rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em}h2{font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3vw,2.25rem);margin-top:56px}.prose p{color:var(--muted)}.prose a{color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:700px){.section{padding-block:60px}}</style>
